{"parse": {"title": "THH-07", "pageid": 64943, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/THH-06\" title=\"THH-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">THH-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/THH-08\" title=\"THH-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">THH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.BE.8A.E7.9A.AE.E7.BA.B8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"羊皮纸\">羊皮纸</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 羊皮纸</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Parchment</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>种<span class=\"color-value\"></span>神<span class=\"color-value\"></span>奇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>介<span class=\"color-value\"></span>质<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>每<span class=\"color-value\"></span>句<span class=\"color-value\"></span>记<span class=\"color-value\"></span>载<span class=\"color-value\"></span>其<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>话<span class=\"color-value\"></span>语<span class=\"color-value\"></span>都<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>如<span class=\"color-value\"></span>至<span class=\"color-value\"></span>理<span class=\"color-value\"></span>名<span class=\"color-value\"></span>言<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2110107</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>这未必是上一位房客留下的痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>实际上，在这个旅馆的所有房间中，或多或少地都存在着一些古怪的痕迹——这些痕迹非常新鲜，存续的时间不会超过一个月。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>那名侍应生说，最近并没有大体量的旅客潮——所以，我猜应当是一个精通秘术的团伙，在各个房间之中流窜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>根据留下的痕迹推断，这个团伙大约有三至五人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>那么，这些人里，有一位羊首人身的神秘学家吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>哈，这我可就不知道了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>但我能告诉您的是……这儿确实有羊存在过的痕迹——我曾在走廊上看到过几只小小的羊蹄印。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>这里曾有人牵着羊来住宿，多么奇怪——但是，这儿是德州，附近多是农户，这样的事情似乎又没有那么奇怪了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>不过，我保证，有一个信息是您一定感兴趣的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>我们都知道，羊用四个蹄子来走路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>但是我看到的足迹显然并不符合这个特征——它小巧而精致。最重要的是，脚印主人的行走方式更接近于人，而且……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>我能看出来，脚印的主人是个瘦弱的孩子，身高约为5英尺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雇佣兵口述的数据与基金会的报告如出一辙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……你说得没有错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>当然——您可以质疑我的为人，但绝不能质疑我的专业水准。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>现在，我可以开始对房间的探查了吗？维尔汀小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>请。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>那么……首先来看看这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>这些刻痕非常新鲜，没有被虫蚁咬噬，也没有遭到水雾的侵蚀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>断口的木刺非常锐利，连……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>痕迹中有一些暗红色的脆质结晶，她伸手蘸取。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/HeadIconSmall-309711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/HeadIconSmall-309711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/HeadIconSmall-309711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>这是……血痂？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她揉搓着那些细碎的结晶，它们随着雇佣兵的动作化为更细碎的粉末。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>它在术阵中作为触媒而使用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这儿，未闭口的圆，用力不匀的线条。从作画方式来看——不是精于此道的专家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>您的身手不错，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>老板，别小瞧我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们需要尽可能快地摧毁这个术阵……我想这是一个危险的密教团体所篆刻的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>稍等。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雇佣兵将枕头垫在了木板之上，随后扣下扳机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>微弱的枪击声之后，残余的亮光熄灭了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哗啦——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>新鲜的血液自术阵中涌出，浸湿了发白的刻痕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……血？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雇佣兵恍若未闻，在错愕的目光中，她用手指蘸取了红色的液体，放在鼻端之下嗅闻着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>这是一个神秘学家的血——不是凯拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……你能看出这位神秘学家的身份吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>老板，你未免有些太高估我了——我并不能通过血的气味定位到某个具体的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>——还需要更多的线索。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雇佣兵从柜子与墙面的缝隙处，摸出了一本遍布灰尘的羊皮手册。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她翻开了手册。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div><i>我等乃金属之第一本质，以及唯一源泉。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div><i>经由我等，伟大艺术之最高酊剂得以酿造。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div><i>无泉无水能似我，我成全贫者和富者，或让他们罹患病灾。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div><i>因我可为良药，可为鸩酒。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……什么意思？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这是一段有关于炼金术的引文。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div><i>只需要准备足量且优质的材料，画出足够准确的术阵，一切问题都能够被解决。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div><i>那么——从哪里可以找到优质的材料？</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她快速地翻动着陈旧的手册，缝隙中堆积的炼金产物飘扬在空气之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后一页中，形态抽搐的文字如同遭受火刑的罪者，于书页上写满了孤独的呓语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div><i>存在的，分裂的，终将走向极一。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>咳、咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鼻腔滚烫，细不可察的火花在空气中涌动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>我看见过这个笔迹。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_yuanye1\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_yuanye1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-627501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-627501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-627501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“启明会”信众Ⅰ：</div><div>还有……这是我的电话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>追随者随之递过来一张美钞，上面潦草地写着一串数字。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雇佣兵从口袋中掏出了那张皱巴巴的钞票，将上面的字迹与羊皮手册进行比对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……是了，两份笔迹的书写特征完全吻合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>砰——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……飞矢M1903式手枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>啊啊啊啊——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……金伯利？怎么哪里都有她？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>老板，外面出岔子了。我得过去看看，你要和我来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>那个金伯利可能看见了什么。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "THH-07"}}